as the wind and seemingly as random.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slime Army High Command has identified roughly <strong>10 major missions</strong> that requires your attention, and there is little time to waste.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight insane bosses</strong>, and lay waste to the enemies of slimekind with the might of the modern military!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380070/extras/b870fba55d44a695fe362efc2217559f.poster.avif?t=1787540355\" width=1026 height=552 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380070/extras/b870fba55d44a695fe362efc2217559f.webm?t=1787540355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380070/extras/b870fba55d44a695fe362efc2217559f.mp4?t=1787540355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380070/extras/632581805ccd6a0851b3546bd230592a.avif?t=1787540355\" width=472 height=89 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices matter.</strong> Balance the slime masses' clamoring for vengeance against the ever-watching judgment of the hardly sympathetic international media.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But also, harpies are by nature <strong>dumb, arrogant and evil</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Good soldiers do not question.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380070/extras/372c5fcde9c0ea054f191526a052f5fd.avif?t=1787540355\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Stretch and slide your squad of slimes to get revenge on the harpies in Slime Squadron: Harpy Raiders, an outlandish RPG platformer. Maybe (intentionally) cause some humanitarian catastrophes along the way. Glory to the Slime Army!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380070/header.jpg?t=1787540355", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380070/2c912cc45f61aaa5337c8a618d4ec0bbdbc21acc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787540355", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380070/2c912cc45f61aaa5337c8a618d4ec0bbdbc21acc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787540355", "website": "https://www.harpyraiders.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Xeon E3-1575M v5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Iris Pro Graphics P580<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Game currently needs Vulkan capable graphics card</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Clouds of Eternity PTE LTD"], "publishers": ["Clouds of Eternity PTE LTD"], "pack